{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Soap.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soap is a movement platformer built on old-school FPS mechanics \u2014 bunnyhopping, strafing, and pure flow. It\u2019s all about finding your rhythm, shaving seconds, and enjoying the ride as you get smoother with every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each season brings its own unique world and vibe:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Season 1</strong> drops you into a neon paradise of tight nightclub-like settings, pulsing with thumping techno and house.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Season 2</strong> shifts into bright outdoor spaces with a breakcore edge \u2014 a classic aesthetic inspired by the early Counter-Strike surf maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Season 3</strong>\u00a0will be a new surprize aesthetic released at the end of the year!\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780420/extras/94ed3903b0a17466757be5f49ea6283c.avif?t=1766502535\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every map features its own original soundtrack, with tracks produced specifically to capture the feel of each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new tutorial makes it easier than ever to dive in, while loads of tweaks and fixes (thanks to community feedback) have helped Soap quickly evolve into something special.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soap is about speed, style, and expression \u2014 whether you\u2019re chasing leaderboards or just vibing with the movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome To Soap!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3780420/6f9f253e4f7baad9bd3f1a36d57f2a68f11bb5d8.jpg"},{"name":"Console Completed!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.c